        <span itemprop="definition">represents an angular frequency at which the storage modulus (G′) and the loss modulus (G′′) obtained by melt viscoelasticity measurement at 180° C. were equal to each other.</span>
        <meta itemprop="num_attr" content="0000">
      </li>
